+- Lattice indexing was temporarily busy and returned guidance to use `rg`, so implementation proceeded with targeted source reads.
+- The first test pass exposed that the T04 `baseline_metrics.json` legacy schema needs adaptation before it can be compared to T65 `MetricValue`s. The harness now fails fast if the baseline file is missing and converts legacy baseline tool/candidate counts into the report-compatible signals used by T68.
+- Formatting initially pushed `regression_tests.rs` over the 800-line ceiling; repeated test boilerplate was collapsed into a macro, bringing the file to 786 lines.
+
+## Final status
+
+complete

